# Check every text file out with LF, whatever `core.autocrlf` says. oxfmt --check fails on CRLF,
# bash can't run a CRLF script, and Git for Windows defaults `autocrlf` to true, so without this a
# plain Windows clone fails `bun run check` on every file.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.dylib binary
*.node binary
